{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>To speak of them.</b> From the moment the child knows how to speak, teach him ״תּוֹרָה צִוָּה לָנוּ מֹשֶׁה״ — let this be the substance of his speech. From here the Sages said: when the child begins to speak, his father converses with him in the Holy Tongue and teaches him Torah. And if he did not do so, it is as though he buried him, as it is said: <b>And you shall teach them to your children, to speak of them, etc.</b>"], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:46:34.349830625Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}